# HozorPlus environment configuration
# ------------------------------------
# On Windows, INSTALL.bat generates the real .env automatically with the
# absolute path of the SQLite database — you normally never edit this.
#
# SQLite (default, zero-config):
DATABASE_URL=file:./db/custom.db
#
# PostgreSQL (optional, for larger deployments):
#   1. change provider to "postgresql" in prisma/schema.prisma
#   2. DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/hozorplus
#   3. npx prisma db push && npx tsx scripts/seed.ts
